          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 1: Folio 1r, left side (Concluding Section)",
          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">as\u0323la\u0304 fa\u0304\u02beide virmese</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>gerekdir. H\u0323a\u0304l-i h\u0323aya\u0304tda</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>iken teda\u0304rik itmek</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>gerek idin dirler.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>I\u0307mdi [in red ink] ey mu\u0308\u02bemin</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>k\u0323ar\u0131ndas\u0327, bu fak\u0323i\u0304rin an\u0303ladug\u0307\u0131</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>oldur-ki K\u0323\u0131ya\u0304met Gu\u0308ni</p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
