      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 1: Folio 1r, left side",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>it would certainly be of no use.</li>\n<li>They would say that you should</li>\n<li>have prepared</li>\n<li>when you were [still] alive.</li>\n<li>Now then [in red ink]: O brother believer,</li>\n<li>this is what the poor one [i.e., the author] has come to understand.</li>\n<li>On the Day of Judgement,</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
