          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Page 4: Folio 1r, right side\u00a0",
          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">nedib, iba\u0304h\u0323at, h\u0323u\u0308rmet,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>kera\u0304het. H\u0323a\u0304s\u0323\u0131l-i kela\u0304m</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>bunun emsa\u0304li \u02bfilm-i</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>h\u0323a\u0304ldan su\u02bea\u0304l itse</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>gerekdir \u02bfa\u0304lem-i du\u0308nya\u0304da</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>ca\u0304n tende iken,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>c\u0327al\u0131s\u0327ub o\u0308g\u0306renmedikc\u0327e</p>\n</li>\n<li>ben (bottom left)</li></ol>\n",
